:: ChurchNunQuest [nobr] {"position":"2075,1500","size":"100,100"}
<<image "characters/rescue/rain.jpg" { class: "displayCentredImgs", width: "50%" }>><br>
<<if not setup.Church.hasMetRain()>>
	<<run setup.Church.initRainIfNeeded()>>
	<<say>>You came. Sit.<</say>><br>
	<<thought>>She's already sitting. There's nowhere else to sit. You stand.<</thought>><br>
	<<say>>I'm Rain. Khadija sent you, so we'll skip the part where I explain what I do.<</say>><br>
	<<mc>>She said you knew her?<</mc>><br>
	<<say>>She wore this collar before I did. We don't talk about it.<</say>><br>
	<<mc>>Is there an order? Could I join?<</mc>><br>
	<<say>>Ask me in six months. If you're still alive.<</say>><br>
	<<thought>>She doesn't blink when she says it. You're not sure she blinks at all.<</thought>><br>
	<<mc>>The missing girls?<</mc>><br>
	<<say>>Board's outside, left of the door. Posters with names and pictures. <em><b>I refresh it at <<displayTime 1800>> every day</b></em>, after I hear which ones came home. Take a poster, and that's your assignment.<br><br>
		They get taken on <em><b>Owaissa or Elm</b></em>, then they end up <em><b>south, in the abandoned houses</b></em>. They don't walk there themselves. You can sweep the south door to door and burn a day on it, or you can <em><b>start on Owaissa or Elm and look for what points you to which house in the south</b></em>. Pick whichever you can afford.<br><br>
		<em><b>You have until <<displayTime 1800>> the next day.</b></em> After that I send hunters who can actually get her out, so don't be later than that.<br><br>
		<em><b>The longer she's down there, the less of her is left to bring back. Take holy water. It's free.</b></em>
	<</say>><br>
	<<mc>>Got it.<</mc>><br>
	<br>
	@@.mc-action; Now I can assist Rain in the search for the missing girls.@@<br>
<</if>>
<<run setup.Church.clearRescueClue()>>
<<if setup.MissingWomen.rescueQuestStage() eq 2>>
	<<say>>This is bad, I'll have to send an experienced ghost hunter to search for her, even though I have very few people available.<</say>><br>
	<<if setup.Church.relationshipWithRain() eq 0>>
	<<else>>
		<<run setup.Church.adjustRainRelationship(-1)>>
		<<thought>>Your relationship with Rain has decreased - <<= setup.Church.relationshipWithRain()>>.<</thought>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif setup.MissingWomen.rescueQuestStage() eq 3>>
	<<say>>Oh, <<= setup.Mc.name()>>, I've already been informed that you found our girl, thank you so much. You've been a great help to me, thank you.<br><</say>>
	<<if setup.Church.upgradeSpiritboxReward()>>
		<<say>>I hope you'll be able to keep helping us. <br>
			I don't have anything to give you in return for your help right now, but maybe I can repay you somehow later.
		<</say>><br>
		@@.mc-action; You get a lvl 3 Spiritbox @@<<image "ui/img/spiritbox.png" { style: "max-width:5%" }>><br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<run setup.Church.adjustRainRelationship(1)>>
	<<thought>>Your relationship with Rain has increased - <<= setup.Church.relationshipWithRain()>> now!<</thought>><br>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<done>>
	<<addclass ".linkselector" "disabled-link">>
<</done>>
@@.backbtn; [[Back|Church][setup.Church.clearRescueQuest()]]@@<br>
